+# --- contribution: <subagent_type> | <unique_question> | <output_ref> | changed_implementation=y/n/- | changed_conclusion=y/n/- | caught_defect=y/n/- | duplicated_work=y/n/- | tokens=<v|-> | cost=<v|-> | time=<v|->
